    "updated_at": "2024-10-31T16:40:18Z",
    "body": "Sorry for the delay getting back to this. But yes I'd like to pick https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/10157 back up. Might take me a minute to wade through the comments there and see what's needed from CloseWatcher. But I just wanted to register interest and intention to continue that work.",
